      "value": "I was just testing it a little again. I can still consistently reproduce it with the steps to reproduce on version 1393. I tried leaving my phone on that screen for 15 minutes, and it hadn't changed at all.\n\nIs there anything else you need? Can the Android version create a log file or anything?\n\nIf I try the same thing on my desktop computer, launching VRChat using the website straight to a Group Public instance I am banned from, I get an error message: \"You are not allowed to travel to that location. If the instance exists, you're not allowed to access it. (Code: 403)\" And I am then sent to my homeworld after clicking \"Okay\" as expected.",
